    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take to the skies in this thrilling 2D drone racing game that combines fast-paced action, challenging physics, and competitive gameplay. Navigate tight turns, avoid obstacles, and master the art of precision flying across dynamic tracks inspired by the excitement of Trackmania.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Driven Gameplay:</strong> Feel the thrill of floaty quadcopter-like controls as you perfect your racing skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Tracks:</strong> Conquer unique courses with speed boosts, control-disrupting gates, and fiery traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards:</strong> Compete with players across Steam for the top spot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Modes:</strong> Build and share your own tracks using our campaign editor and then challenge friends or the community through the Steam workshop.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a casual gamer or a competitive racer,\u00a0 drone dash delivers endless fun, skillful challenges, and general sillyness.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take to the skies in this thrilling 2D drone racing game that combines fast-paced action, challenging physics, and competitive gameplay. Navigate tight turns, avoid obstacles, and master the art of precision flying across dynamic tracks inspired by the excitement of Trackmania.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Driven Gameplay:</strong> Feel the thrill of floaty quadcopter-like controls as you perfect your racing skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Tracks:</strong> Conquer unique courses with speed boosts, control-disrupting gates, and fiery traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards:</strong> Compete with players across Steam for the top spot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Modes:</strong> Build and share your own tracks using our campaign editor and then challenge friends or the community through the Steam workshop.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a casual gamer or a competitive racer,\u00a0 drone dash delivers endless fun, skillful challenges, and general sillyness.</p>",
